      "prompt": "Daily snapshot: commit and push .hermes changes in tigor-ai to main (GitHub), Forgejo as fallback.\n\n```bash\ncd /home/nixos/tigor-ai\ngit status --short\ngit add .hermes/\ngit commit -m \"auto: daily snapshot $(date +%Y-%m-%d)\" --allow-empty-message\n\n# Primary: push to GitHub main\ngit -c \"credential.helper=!/home/nixos/tigor-ai/.hermes/scripts/git-credential-github\" push github-pull-and-push-to-main main\nif [ $? -ne 0 ]; then\n  # Fallback: push to Forgejo\n  . /opt/data/secrets/forgejo.conf\n  git remote set-url forgejo-push-for-preview \"http://${FORGEJO_USER}:${FORGEJO_PASS}@10.67.69.2:${FORGEJO_PORT}/hermes/tigor-ai.git\"\n  git push forgejo-push-for-preview main\nfi\n```\n\nReport output of each command. If commit has no changes, that's fine — report it. If both pushes fail, report the error.",
